{"total_count":18,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/31624","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/31624/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/31624/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/31624/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/31624","id":3776573415,"node_id":"I_kwDOI7xefs7hGe_n","number":31624,"title":"[Bug]: ModelOpt Llama-4 Checkpoints Take 5+ minutes to load","user":{"login":"robertgshaw2-redhat","id":114415538,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtHXsg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114415538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat","html_url":"https://github.com/robertgshaw2-redhat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertgshaw2-redhat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5135047172,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABMhKaBA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5135047193,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABMhKaGQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5135047198,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABMhKaHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5645279504,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABUHwhEA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/feature%20request","name":"feature request","color":"a2eeef","default":false,"description":"New feature or request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":25,"created_at":"2026-01-02T15:18:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:50:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### 🚀 The feature, motivation and pitch\n\nIn working on some MoE refactors, I discovered that L4 for ModelOpt takes 5+minutes to load weights even from CPU page cache. \n- https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Llama-4-Scout-17B-16E-Instruct-FP8\n\nThe root cause is basically this hack logic to load the state dict that ModelOpt uses\n- https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/main/vllm/model_executor/models/llama4.py#L439-L523 [modelopt is the fused case] \n\nWhat happens is that the CPU tensor (loaded weight) that we are going to load into the GPU tensor (param) becomes non-contiguous due to this logic. As a result, when we eventually call `_copy()` from CPU->GPU we are calling this on a non-contiguous cpu tensor which takes 3-4s per weight.\n\nTo hack around this for local R&D, I simply immediately move the loaded_weight to the GPU. This makes the gather happen on the GPU which accelerates things a lot. This isn't reasonable as an actual solution though\n\nWe should investigate where the logic in the weight loader can avoid creating non-contiguous CPU tensors\n\n\n### Alternatives\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_\n\n### Before submitting a new issue...\n\n- [x] Make sure you already searched for relevant issues, and asked the chatbot living at the bottom right corner of the [documentation page](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/), which can answer lots of frequently asked questions.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/31624/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/31624/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/23957","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/23957/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/23957/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/23957/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/23957","id":3367706728,"node_id":"I_kwDOI7xefs7IuyBo","number":23957,"title":"[Feature]: Support `Phi4Flash` model in V1","user":{"login":"tdoublep","id":7945038,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDUwMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7945038?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep","html_url":"https://github.com/tdoublep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdoublep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5135047193,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABMhKaGQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5135047198,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABMhKaHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5645279504,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABUHwhEA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/feature%20request","name":"feature request","color":"a2eeef","default":false,"description":"New feature or request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7652610994,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAAByCGTsg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/unstale","name":"unstale","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Recieved activity after being labelled stale","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2025-08-29T18:31:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:02:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### 🚀 The feature, motivation and pitch\n\nWe will drop support for V0 in the very near future, and if we want to continue supporting this model in vLLM, it needs to be ported to V1.\n\nThe main work here is in:\n1. Adapting the custom Mamba layer to match how V1 manages the mamba state. The MambaMixer, MambaMixer2, MinimaxLinearAttention and ShortConv can all be used as a reference for how to do this.\n2. Porting the differential attention backend to V1. \n\n### Alternatives\n\nDrop model support in vLLM\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_\n\n### Before submitting a new issue...\n\n- [x] Make sure you already searched for relevant issues, and asked the chatbot living at the bottom right corner of the [documentation page](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/), which can answer lots of frequently asked questions.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/23957/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/23957/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/27433","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/27433/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/27433/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/27433/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/27433","id":3546273461,"node_id":"I_kwDOI7xefs7TX9a1","number":27433,"title":"[Feature]: Batch Invariant Feature and Performance Optimization","user":{"login":"yewentao256","id":44945378,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTQ1Mzc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44945378?v=4","gravatar_id":"","